# COMPONENT

## JobSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.job

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal job-management sample component.

### SPECIFICATION

This component exists to demonstrate the CNCF job lifecycle around one command.

# SERVICE

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Item-facing command used to create a job-backed execution.

### OPERATION

#### createItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates an item through the standard job-backed command path.

##### IN

Item creation payload.

##### OUT

Job-backed command result.

# ENTITY

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal entity used by the job sample.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

# COMMAND

## CreateItem

### DESCRIPTION

Command to create an item through a job-backed path.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| name  | name   | 1            |
| title | string | 1            |

# OPERATION

## createItem

### TYPE
COMMAND

### IMPLEMENTATION
echo-record

### INPUT
CreateItem

### OUTPUT
CreateItemResult
